OL,3,ABank of England holds interest rates at
OL,4,A3.75%, but governor says high energy
OL,5,Acosts may lead to increase
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Bank of England has held interest
OL,8,Frates at 3.75%
OL,10,FSix members of the Monetary Policy
OL,11,FCommittee, which makes the decision,
OL,12,Fvoted to hold the rate, while the other
OL,13,Fthree wanted an increase to 4%
OL,15,FThe hold comes despite rising inflation
OL,16,F- the UK rate is 3.1%, well above the
OL,17,FBank's 2% target
OL,19,FThe Bank's governor, Andrew Bailey,
OL,20,Fsays higher energy costs would make an
OL,21,Finterest rate rise more likely
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
